{
 "encounter_id": "00858",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm Anjali, I'm Mrs Pereira's carer. She's been dizzy when she stands up, and I'm worried she'll fall."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, it's not so bad, a little giddy sometimes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mrs Pereira, tell me when it happens."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I get out of bed, or up from my chair. Everything goes grey."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has this been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week or two, perhaps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's been a month at least. I've seen her hold the wall since the start of last month."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So a week or two from you, a month or more from Anjali. I'll put it as two weeks to a month. Any fainting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I've not fainted."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain or palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any falls?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She had a near fall last Tuesday. I caught her."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets does she take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 10 mg, once a day, and a water tablet, bendroflumethiazide, 2.5 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, none."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Just high blood pressure. And her hips are bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is she eating and drinking enough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She's not drinking much, and she's eating less. Her appetite has gone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm not hungry, dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check her pulse and blood pressure, first sitting, then standing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll help her up. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sitting, 142 over 80, pulse 70. Now standing, 108 over 62, pulse 82.",
   "pause": 60.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's a big drop. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, a drop of more than 30 points on standing. That fits her symptoms. I'd say this is postural hypotension, likely from the blood pressure tablets together with not drinking enough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Can we change the tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. I'd like to stop the water tablet, bendroflumethiazide, and keep the amlodipine for now, but at 5 mg."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And please encourage her to drink at least six glasses of fluid a day, and to sit on the bed for a minute before standing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see her again in two weeks, to recheck her pressure. If she faints, falls, or has chest pain, call 999."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
